      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Complex 1 is a zero-field Dy4 SMM. DC susceptibility at 1000 Oe shows χMT = 56.54 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K, close to four free Dy(III) ions, decreasing to 10.16 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. M vs H/T plots are non-superimposable, indicating magnetic anisotropy. AC susceptibilities show a clear out-of-phase signal at 0 Oe (9–999 Hz). Cole–Cole data fit a single Debye process (α = 0.15–0.29). Arrhenius analysis under 0 dc field gives Ueff = 30.7(3) K and τ0 = 1.8(1)×10−5 s.",
